{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>At the time of life.</b> At this time, in the following year, and Sarah is alive, like \"long life to you\" (1 Samuel 25:6)." "<b>And he was behind him.</b> This angel who speaks with Abraham was behind the tent, and Abraham sits at the entrance of the tent and did not see Sarah. And some say: the entrance of her tent was behind Abraham's tent."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:54.371071513Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}